   "text": "Mercer University - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nMercer University\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nMercer University is one of America’s oldest and most distinctive institutions of higher learning, offering rigorous programs and ranked among the top tier and best values of national research universities by U.S. News & World Report. While offering a breadth of programs found at much larger universities, Mercer maintains an intimate, student-focused culture more characteristic of smaller liberal arts colleges. Mercer’s uniqueness is found in the way the University integrates five defining components of its mission: Liberal Learning, Professional Knowledge, Discovery, Service to Humankind and Community.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n31/03/2026 11:25\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n31/03/2026 11:25\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$55,000.00\nMin: US$35,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n1,800 of 9,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nStudy Group\nFounded Year\n1837\nCampus(es)\nAtlanta, Macon\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n01/04/2026\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.mercer.edu/life-at-mercer/housing-dining/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/user/MercerUniversity\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
